.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH bap-init 1  "bap-init " 
.SH NAME
bap\-init \- Scaffold a bap.json for this project
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbap\-init\fR [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Scaffold a bap.json for this project
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Overwrite an existing bap.json
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
Pin the module format instead of auto\-detecting per file
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
esm
.IP \(bu 2
cjs
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print machine\-readable JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  bap init
  bap init \-\-format cjs \-\-force
